# Braided Net enters with three net counters (CR 122.6). Its ability ("another target nonland permanent": not the Net
# itself, not a land) taps Bot2's Vampire Hexmage and removes a net counter, and the Hexmage's activated ability - a
# sacrifice, no tapping needed - can't be activated for as long as it remains tapped (CR 602.5, 611.2b). Bot2's untap
# step untaps it, which ends the effect, and Bot2 then sacrifices it to remove every counter from the Net, which with no
# net counter left can't pay its own cost again.

